<title>USA: Congo buys 3,525 T PL 480 soybean oil.</title>
<headline>Congo buys 3,525 T PL 480 soybean oil.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Congo bought about 3,525 tonnes soybean oil under the PL 480 program for Nov 5-20 shipment, USDA said.</p>
<p>The deal included 1,500 tonnes from ADM at $848.33 a tonne, free alongside (FAS) and 2,025.828 tonnes at $852.74 from ADM out of Lake Charles, La.</p>
<p>--Doris Frankel 312-983-7351</p>
</text>
